 "brief": "Resistance committees in Palestine marked the fifteenth anniversary of the Wafa al-Ahrar prisoner exchange on Tuesday, Shehab Wire reported. In a statement, the committees said the 2011 swap demonstrated the scale of Palestinian sacrifice and that the prisoners' cause would remain central to Palestinian struggle.\n\nThe Wafa al-Ahrar deal saw the release of over 1,000 Palestinian detainees held by Israel in exchange for captured Israeli soldier Gilad Shalit.",
